# Files kept in the repo but deliberately NOT uploaded to the deployment.
#
# This project has no build step: Vercel serves the repo as static files, so
# anything committed under pages/ is reachable at a public URL. That is fine for
# the pages meant to be shown and a problem for the ones kept only as source
# material, which is what this file is for.
#
# pages/decision-workspace-v2.html is the 9 Aug prototype the current Decision
# Space was ported from. It is retained because two comments in
# pages/app-shell-intro.html cite it as the provenance of that port, so deleting
# it would leave those comments pointing at nothing. It must not ship: it is a
# pre-port snapshot, so its copy and numbers now contradict the live page, and
# anyone who found the URL would reasonably read it as current.
pages/decision-workspace-v2.html
